+- `src/apxinf_robo/npu_torch.py`：+`_SilentLogger`、+`_axis_angle_to_quat`、+noise 注入、+state 7→8 适配、+`model_type/device` 规范化、+`tokenizer_path` 别名、+`discrete_state` metadata
